  <p id="c-chenshu-016-shenmiaorong-liushizhi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-016-shenmiaorong-liushizhi:p001:m0000" ref="tpj_u6z_dq1_A">劉師知</persName>，沛國相人也。家世素族。祖<persName id="c-chenshu-016-shenmiaorong-liushizhi:p001:m0016" ref="cei_n7j_fxp">奚之</persName>，齊晉安王諮議參軍，淮南太守，有能政，齊武帝手詔頻褒賞。父<persName id="c-chenshu-016-shenmiaorong-liushizhi:p001:m0047" ref="tpj_u6z_dq1">景彥</persName>，梁尚書左丞、司農卿。</p>
</text>
